comment "Iccmsg Driver Options"

config ICCMSG_TRACE
	bool "Enable iccmsg RX/TX frame trace recording"
	default y
	help
	  Enable recording of received and transmitted protocol frames
	  in per-instance trace buffers. Useful for debugging but
	  adds memory and CPU overhead in high-frequency data paths.
	  Disable for production builds to improve performance.
